libmpv for Android: pinned prebuilt binaries (no nix-flake builds).

Source: https://github.com/media-kit/libmpv-android-video-build/releases/tag/v1.1.11
Flavor: `full` (required: the `default` flavor's FFmpeg is built with
`--disable-decoders` and its explicit enable list omits the HDMV PGS / bitmap
subtitle decoder `hdmv_pgs_subtitle`, so Blu-ray PGS subs never render; the
`full` flavor includes `ff_pgssub_decoder`. It is a superset of `default`
otherwise — same release, same system deps).

